// The first program decided in the kernel (spec 013.4): one fact, one creation, two
// claims of which the second is false, and an invariant. `charter prove` must decide
// the true claim and the invariant and report the false claim as failed.
//! prove-failed: 1
Fact x Identified by A.
+x(A).
?x(A).
?!x(A).
Invariant inv When x(A).
